{
  "info": {
    "name": "EcoTrack API - ESG",
    "description": "Collection da API EcoTrack (Spring Boot + Oracle + Docker).\n\nPra usar:\n1. Sobe o projeto com `docker compose up --build`\n2. Importa essa collection no Postman\n3. A variavel {{baseUrl}} ja aponta pra http://localhost:8080\n4. A auth Basic ja ta configurada na collection (admin@ecotrack.com / admin123)\n\nDados iniciais (Flyway V2):\n- Empresa id=1: Verde Bebidas LTDA\n- Empresa id=2: Solar Tech S.A.\n- Empresa id=3: Empresa Teste Delete (usada no DELETE)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      {
        "key": "username",
        "value": "admin@ecotrack.com",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "password",
        "value": "admin123",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
